# Run: python3 -I tools/build_set.py tools/sets/math3.py
# Math is written left-to-right inside Hebrew text: {…} is wrapped in Unicode isolates (LRI…PDI).
# Division uses ":" as in Israeli schools; remainder is written "3 ושארית 2". Units: ס״מ, מ״מ, ק״מ, ק״ג (real gershayim).
